        "To everyone using the land in north Yamakawa: Under the city's development plan, this land will be used as a new commercial area from next April. For this reason, the current dojo will need to leave by the end of March. We will explain the details at the information meeting on October 10. Please note that the plan will be finally decided by the city council in December. Higashiyama City Hall, Town Planning Section",
